{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioLogicWorkspace",
  "$description": "⑪ · Logic — the Bottom dock tab where a formula and a function body are edited BESIDE the page they compute. One tab, two surfaces, one header: `panels/formula-workspace.ts` decides which of them is open (a `$expression` or a Monaco body), what it is called and what its verbs are, and this draws both. The chip pipeline is a projection of `ui/formula-chips.ts`'s model — the expression tree read left to right — and a chip click reports its key back; nothing here unrolls a tree, reads a document or evaluates anything. Three ISLANDS, each an empty host this document draws and the flow fills (studio-ui-guidelines.md §9.4): `[part=\"code-host\"]` takes Monaco, `[part=\"editor-host\"]` takes the expression editor, which is a lit surface of its own and another conversion's to move, and one `[part=\"tree-host\"]` per data-rail entry takes the value tree, which is a mounted document of its own (`surfaces/panel-data.json`). The rail's trees had been empty since that tree became a document, because the lit takeover rendered a host nothing ever filled; announcing them is what fills them.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "workspace"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What the seventeen `fw-*` rules of `styles/panels.css` said, keyed on `part`. THE CONSTRAINT IS THE HEIGHT, and it is why every rule here looks tight: a dock is not a stage, so the whole surface has to fit ~240px with the page still rendering above it — the header, the chip pipeline and the result are one line each, and only the editor and the data rail scroll. Four token families moved on the way. `--spectrum-font-size-50` and `--spectrum-font-size-75` resolve only inside `<sp-theme>`, and this document is mounted in the Bottom dock's body where that element is not an ancestor, so both would silently have taken their px fallback: they are the kit's own scale here (`--jx-text-sm`, `--jx-text-md`), which is the step each of them was. A CHIP's greys were `--spectrum-gray-100/300/800`, the same problem, and they are the studio layer's `--bg-input`, `--border` and `--fg` — the three roles they were chosen for. A live BADGE was `--spectrum-gray-200` on `--spectrum-seafoam-900`; a resolved value is the reading that says the formula works, so it is `--success` on `--bg`. And a chip's 10px radius is `--jx-radius-lg`, which is that value exactly. Two rules were DELETED rather than moved: `.fw-browse-catalog` and `.fw-close` styled nothing — they existed so a lit template could hold a handle on its own button — and `jx-action-button` is the button.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "minHeight": "0",
    "height": "100%",
    "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "& [part=\"frame\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "flex": "1",
      "minHeight": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"formula\"]": {
      "$description": "The formula surface's own column inside the frame: chips, the two-column body, and the result line. It is a second flex column rather than the header's sibling because the header is shared with the code surface and this is not.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "flex": "1",
      "minHeight": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"frame\"][data-surface=\"code\"]": {
      "$description": "The code surface has no chip strip, no rail and no result line, so Monaco takes the height the formula surface spends on all three.",
      "overflow": "hidden"
    },
    "& [part=\"header\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "gap": "8px",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "padding": "6px 10px",
      "borderBottom": "1px solid var(--border)"
    },
    "& [part=\"title\"]": {
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    },
    "& [part=\"kind\"]": {
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"gap\"]": {
      "$description": "The header is a row of two groups — what is open, and what you can do to it — and this is the space between them. A margin on the verbs would have to be spelled on whichever verb happens to come first, which changes when one of them is conditional.",
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"chips\"]": {
      "$description": "The pipeline reads left to right and wraps rather than scrolling sideways: a chip you have to find by scrolling is one you do not know is there. It never shrinks, because it is the surface's table of contents.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "4px",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "padding": "4px 10px",
      "borderBottom": "1px solid var(--border)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]": {
      "display": "inline-flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "maxWidth": "180px",
      "padding": "1px 7px",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-lg)",
      "background": "var(--bg-input)",
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "lineHeight": "18px",
      "cursor": "pointer"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]:hover": {
      "$description": "The takeover's chips had no hover state at all, which made a row of pressable things look like a row of labels. Nothing else on this surface changes colour on hover, so the border is enough to say it.",
      "borderColor": "var(--accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip-label\"]": {
      "maxWidth": "110px",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    },
    "& [part=\"badge\"]": {
      "$description": "The live value (spec §19.9). A resolved formula is arbitrary text — an object, a URL, a paragraph — so it ellipsizes inside the chip it annotates and never sets the chip's width.",
      "flex": "0 1 auto",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "maxWidth": "120px",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "padding": "0 5px",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--bg)",
      "color": "var(--success)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "lineHeight": "16px",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    },
    "& [part=\"body\"]": {
      "$description": "The two columns, and the only thing in the tab that scrolls vertically.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flex": "1",
      "minHeight": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"editor\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "auto",
      "padding": "8px 10px"
    },
    "& [part=\"selected\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "4px",
      "paddingBottom": "6px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"selected-node\"]": {
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)"
    },
    "& [part=\"editor-host\"]": {
      "$description": "The expression editor's island. It gets `min-width: 0` and nothing else: the editor inside it is a flex chain that must be allowed to shrink, and this is the rung of it this document owns.",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"rail\"]": {
      "$description": "Narrower than the takeover's 280px slab: at dock height it is a reference column beside the editor, and the live values it used to be the only source of are on the canvas now.",
      "flex": "0 0 200px",
      "overflow": "auto",
      "padding": "8px 10px",
      "borderLeft": "1px solid var(--border)"
    },
    "& [part=\"rail-title\"]": {
      "paddingBottom": "6px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "letterSpacing": "0.5px",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "textTransform": "uppercase"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry\"]": {
      "marginBottom": "8px"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry-head\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "6px",
      "alignItems": "baseline"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry-name\"]": {
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry-type\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"tree-host\"]": {
      "$description": "What `.data-tree` said. One entry's value tree is a mounted document of its own, and a deep one is capped rather than allowed to push the entries under it off the rail.",
      "padding": "2px 0",
      "maxHeight": "300px",
      "overflowY": "auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"code-host\"]": {
      "$description": "Monaco's host. It must have a real height of its own — the editor measures its container, and a flex item with an `auto` minimum would report the editor's own content height back at itself.",
      "flex": "1",
      "minHeight": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"result\"]": {
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "6px",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "padding": "6px 10px",
      "borderTop": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--success)",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    },
    "& [part=\"result-text\"]": {
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis"
    },
    "& [part=\"result\"][data-tone=\"error\"]": {
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"result\"][data-tone=\"pending\"]": {
      "$description": "Not a value: a sentence saying why there is none. It leaves the monospace face the two real answers wear, so \"nothing has evaluated this yet\" cannot be misread as a result.",
      "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"result-note\"]": {
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The one empty-state pattern (`panels/empty-state.ts`), drawn here because a document cannot render a lit helper. `.empty-state` keeps its stylesheet while every panel still lit renders through that helper, so this is a copy rather than a move.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flex": "1",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-message\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "state-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/state"
      },
      "cases": {
        "empty": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-message"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.emptyMessage}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ready": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "frame",
            "data-surface": "${state.surface}"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "header"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "title",
                    "title": "${state.titleHint}"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.glyph} ${state.name}"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "kind"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.kind}"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "gap",
                    "aria-hidden": "true"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "catalog-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "display": "contents"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/hasCatalog"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "true": {
                      "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "catalog"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "size": "sm",
                        "quiet": true,
                        "icon": "brackets-curly",
                        "haspopup": "menu",
                        "label": "Browse catalog"
                      },
                      "onclick": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/browseCatalog"
                            },
                            "value": [
                              {
                                "$ref": "event#/currentTarget"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "textContent": "Catalog"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "close"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "size": "sm",
                    "quiet": true,
                    "icon": "x",
                    "label": "Close"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/close"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "Close"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "surface-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/surface"
              },
              "cases": {
                "code": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "code-host"
                  }
                },
                "missing": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "p",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "empty-message"
                      },
                      "textContent": "${state.missingMessage}"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "formula": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "formula"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "chips",
                        "role": "group",
                        "aria-label": "Formula pipeline"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "$prototype": "Array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/chips"
                          },
                          "key": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                          },
                          "map": {
                            "tagName": "button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "chip",
                              "type": "button",
                              "data-path": "${$map.item.key}",
                              "title": "${$map.item.label}"
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/selectChip"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "chip-label"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                              },
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "badge-slot",
                                  "role": "none"
                                },
                                "style": {
                                  "display": "contents"
                                },
                                "$switch": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/hasBadge"
                                },
                                "cases": {
                                  "true": {
                                    "tagName": "span",
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "part": "badge",
                                      "title": "${$map.item.badge}"
                                    },
                                    "textContent": "${$map.item.badge}"
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "body"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "editor"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "selected"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "tagName": "span",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "selected-label"
                                  },
                                  "textContent": "Selected:"
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "span",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "selected-node"
                                  },
                                  "textContent": "${state.selectedSummary}"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "editor-host"
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "rail"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "rail-title"
                              },
                              "textContent": "Data"
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "rail-slot",
                                "role": "none"
                              },
                              "style": {
                                "display": "contents"
                              },
                              "$switch": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/hasScope"
                              },
                              "cases": {
                                "false": {
                                  "tagName": "div",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "empty"
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tagName": "p",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "empty-message"
                                      },
                                      "textContent": "${state.scopeEmptyMessage}"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                "true": {
                                  "tagName": "div",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "rail-list"
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "$prototype": "Array",
                                      "items": {
                                        "$ref": "#/state/scopeEntries"
                                      },
                                      "key": {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      "map": {
                                        "tagName": "div",
                                        "attributes": {
                                          "part": "entry",
                                          "data-entry": "${$map.item.key}"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                          {
                                            "tagName": "div",
                                            "attributes": {
                                              "part": "entry-head"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                              {
                                                "tagName": "span",
                                                "attributes": {
                                                  "part": "entry-name"
                                                },
                                                "textContent": "${$map.item.name}"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "tagName": "span",
                                                "attributes": {
                                                  "part": "entry-type"
                                                },
                                                "textContent": "${$map.item.type}"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "tagName": "div",
                                            "attributes": {
                                              "part": "tree-host"
                                            }
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "result",
                        "data-tone": "${state.resultTone}",
                        "role": "status"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "result-text"
                          },
                          "textContent": "${state.resultText}"
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "note-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "display": "contents"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/hasResultNote"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "true": {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "result-note"
                              },
                              "textContent": "${state.resultNote}"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
